  NextScene: Credits
  PlayOncePerSession: 1
  Lines:
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CHe\u2019s unconscious.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CQuick, we need him to be restrained!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWe don\u2019t know what he\u2019ll pull next.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CYou two, stay here and keep an eye on him.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI\u2019ll gather help.\u201D"
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: "The village is free from Junandar\u2019s hand."
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: But not from the possibility of another food attack.
  - Speaker: . . .
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    Text: A thorough investigation of the scene found no traces of what caused the food to mutate and gain life.
